      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今晚不出去，我们在家看电影吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好啊，你想看什么类型？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "轻松一点儿的，不要太长。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "喜剧怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以。我今天不想看太复杂的故事。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我们选一个九十分钟左右的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你想开中文字幕吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "想。这样听不懂的时候可以看一下。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不过别每句话都停下来查。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "放心，今晚主要是放松。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好。要不要准备一点儿水果？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我去洗苹果。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我来泡茶。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "最近我发现看电影也能学到不少口语。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，尤其是一些很自然的说法。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "但是今天我只记一两个就够了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这就对了，别把休息也变成任务。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc018_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
